        <body>
            <div xml:id="d383">

                <pb facs="0299" n="295" xml:id="pg295"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">493.11/2112: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-03-17T19:00:00-05:00">March 17, 1938—7 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>82. Your 175, March 16, 5 p.m., in regard to the Fan Biological Institute at
                    Peiping. The Department perceives no objection to your taking, orally and
                    informally, the action suggested.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
